title: 'statement-store: land the gated v2 DHT-affinity path'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    Lands the statement-store DHT-affinity work: a v2 gossip path that routes
    statements to interested peers by topic affinity instead of flooding.
    The path is experimental and off by default; a node runs it only with the
    `STATEMENT_STORE_V2_DHT_ENABLED=1` environment variable set. With the gate
    off, node behavior is unchanged.
crates:
- name: sc-network-statement
  bump: major
- name: sc-statement-store
  bump: major
- name: sc-network
  bump: major
- name: sp-statement-store
  bump: minor
- name: polkadot-omni-node-lib
  bump: major
- name: staging-node-cli
  bump: minor
